  "content": "This lesson uses every field a lesson file can have. Text before the first heading becomes the Introduction card.\n\n## Greetings\n\nSay **hola** when you arrive and **adiós** when you leave.\n\n| Español | English |\n|---|---|\n| hola | hello |\n| adiós | goodbye |\n\n## Asking how someone is\n\n- **¿Qué tal?** How's it going?\n- *Muy bien, gracias.* Very well, thanks.\n\n> **¿Qué tal?** works with friends and strangers alike.\n\n## The verb hablar\n\nIn the past: **hablé**, **hablaste**, **habló**.\n\n```text\n## not a heading: it is inside a code block\n```\n\n## Numbers\n\n**Dos** más **dos** son **cuatro**: 2 + 2 = 4.",
